Z||000011||voyagerspe||12-30-2001||01:26 AM||||I ve been using paypal since the beginning and have had many transations with them, No problems at all. I have to praise them I had a ebay seller that I bought a cd writer from the seller never shipped it and kept stalling with one excuse after another finnaly I filed a complant with paypal and they got me the money back in less then a week. <BR>||||reg||1
